WEBVTT

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.930
Is everybody okay
back there?

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.930
Super-duper, Dad!

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:22.770
(LAUGHING)
Let's do that again.

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:25.250
(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:28.650
Wait here and stay hidden.
I'm going in.

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:32.250
While what?
I watch helplessly
from the sidelines?

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.330
I don't think so.

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:34.770
I'm asking you to
wait with the kids.

00:00:34.890 --> 00:00:37.490
And I'm telling
you not a chance.
You're my husband.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.410
I'm with you for
better or worse.

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:41.490
I have to do this alone.

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:43.490
What is this to you?
Playtime?
No.

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:45.450
So you can be
Mr. Incredible again?
No!

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:46.810
Then what?
I'm not...

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:48.890
Not what?
I'm not strong enough.

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:51.050
This will make
you stronger?
Yes. No!

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.130
That's what this is?
Some sort of workout?

00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:55.170
I can't lose you again!

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.490
I can't. Not again.

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:02.050
I'm not strong enough.

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:13.570
If we work together,
you won't have to be.

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:14.850
I don't know
what'll happen.

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:17.930
We're superheroes.
What can happen?

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:19.410
(SCREAMING)

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:24.370
Vi! Dash! No!

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:35.250
Violet?

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:39.770
Dad!

00:01:39.850 --> 00:01:41.010
Go, go!

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:52.850
I'm okay, Mom. Really.

00:01:52.930 --> 00:01:54.210
Stay here, okay?

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:06.610
Frozone!

00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:07.930
BOB: Yeah!

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:11.810
Bob!

00:02:13.130 --> 00:02:14.130
Hey!

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:31.690
Syndrome's remote!

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:42.850
The remote
controls the robot!

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:47.410
Throw it, throw it!

00:02:47.490 --> 00:02:48.730
Go long!

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:01.170
Got it!

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:08.010
Honey, take out its guns!

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:16.370
FROZONE: Gotcha!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:56.490
(VIOLET SCREAMS)

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:04.090
Mom, I've got it!
I've got the remote!

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:08.450
A remote?
A remote that
controls what?

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:12.530
The robot?

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:21.930
It's coming back!

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:24.210
(BOB YELLS)

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:26.490
That wasn't right.
Give me that!

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:31.530
We can't stop it.
The only thing hard enough
to penetrate it is

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:36.530
itself.

00:04:36.610 --> 00:04:37.810
It's getting closer!

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:39.050
It doesn't work!

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.210
HELEN: Kids!

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:43.050
FROZONE: It's not
doing anything.

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:44.130
Try to buy us
some time.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.290
Try the one next to it.

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:52.130
Honey!

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:00.450
Wait a minute.
Press that button again!

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:04.650
No, the other one!
The first one!

00:05:04.730 --> 00:05:05.890
First button! Got it!

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:07.650
It's getting closer!
Look out!

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:09.970
Get out of here!

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:11.250
We're not
going anywhere.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:12.970
BOB: Press the button!
Not yet!

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:14.250
FROZONE: Helen!

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.650
What are you
waiting for?

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:18.090
A closer target!
You got one shot!

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:22.810
Everybody duck!

